// Unified Scalar Optimization Engine: SCCP, Algebraic InstCombine, Dominator-Scoped GVN/CSE,
// Effect-Aware Worklist DCE, and CFG Dead-Edge Pruning over OptIR + MemorySSA (T603 / E15.1).
// Implements SPEC-70 §7-§9 (AXS-OPT-013, AXS-OPT-022..024, AXS-OPT-030..034, AXS-OPT-040..047,
// REQ-OPT-011, REQ-OPT-014, REQ-OPT-304..306, REQ-OPT-339, REQ-OPT-351..353, REQ-OPT-363..364, REQ-OPT-397).
